                <p>For texts of the notes exchanged on April 24, see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, May 5, 1946, pp. 761–762.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d300-f2" n="26" xml:id="d300-f2-content">
                <p>For text of the press release issued by the Department of State on April 24,
                    1946, on the occasion of the exchange of notes of the same date, see <hi
